\f1\b \cf0 /NIMBLE Mock Analysis -
\f0\b0  Contains three scripts for processing empirical metabarcoding data derived from and then estimating models for these data output using Nimble (Model A as described in Supplement S1).  \
\

\f1\b ./Mock_analysis_Nimble_dataPrep_00.R 
\f0\b0 - This reads in data from .csv files in the Data folder, and manipulates it to get it ready to be analyzed in a statistical model.\
\

\f1\b ./Mock_analysis_Nimble_estimation_01.R - 
\f0\b0 This script takes the data compiled and manipulated in \'93Mock_analysis_Nimble_dataPrep_00.R\'94  and estimates a statistical model from the inputs using NIMBLE.
